Changelog: 22-11-2026 22:36:54

Fixed. The text of the window, the dialogs, the messages, install.sh, run.sh and the README is rewritten to the writing
standard: short sentences, one fact each, lists for the tiles and the installer's options, and American English (check,
gray, anymore). The question before a local app that changes the board now opens with Start <name>?. No label is
renamed. The info text and the README now name Nexus Garbage Remover among the development apps. They left it out,
although it has a tile. The README now also names the Close issues tile among the tools. Nothing the app does has
changed. tests/test_issues.py and tests/test_tours.py expect the new wording of two messages.

